    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_03",
      "hash64": "17B1F7D2AF61C78A",
      "text": "奪面隊到這裡就算是\\n功成身退了吧。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0480_sister_04",
      "hash64": "17B1F2D2AF61BF0B",
      "text": "阿栗他……\\n回家之後就一直\\r\\n關在房間裡不出來。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
